KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
Template argument deduction fails for basic_ostream on libc++-20
because the struct symbol has no ID_C_template metadata (it was
elaborated from a forward declaration in __fwd/ostream.h).
The deduction can't match the struct against the template pattern
to extract _CharT and _Traits. Works on libc++-18 where the
struct has ID_C_template set.
